ank Ocean is a dream come true. It's been amazing!\"; Dave: \"I bet performing with him is like a dream come true! How did it happen?\"; Calvin: \"It all started August last year\" (August 2022) \"when we met at a festival and he said he wanted to collaborate. We clicked right away and the chemistry on stage was incredible. I'm so lucky!\" — sharing a photo of the two of them on stage (a band performing on stage with a projection of a man on the wall) — \"Check the photo, of how we perfectly look together on stage!\" (tour and origin details in ## Frank Ocean collaboration); Dave: \"Wow, Calvin - you and Frank are so in tune! It's clear you both rock on stage. Can't wait to catch your show!\"; Calvin: \"I'm so excited you'll be at one of our shows. It's such a great experience, you'll definitely enjoy it!\" — sharing a photo of the audience (a large crowd of people in a large auditorium) — \"Look at this crowd, that was insane!\"; Dave: \"That sounds really exciting! Can't wait to experience it. I'm sure everyone in the crowd is going to be pumped up!\" [S24T1][S24T2][S24T3][S24T4][S24T5][S24T6][S24T7][S24T8].","text_sha256":"b25706be2022740005c05f273021b132311c1c5f643d663cdd80b3a0306455fd","timestamp":"2023-10-19T10:11:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D15:1","D15:2","D15:3","D15:4","D15:5","D15:6","D15:7","D15:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":205,"line_start":205,"source_locators":["[S15T1]","[S15T2]","[S15T3]","[S15T4]","[S15T5]","[S15T6]","[S15T7]","[S15T8]"],"text_sha256":"2f3b8f14bb895f019b93c19897a513f90a15a7fe674cee09500dd03fcb11b441"}],"dia_ids":["D15:1","D15:2","D15:3","D15:4","D15:5","D15:6","D15:7","D15:8"],"evidence_id":"ev-9c289c1c15543c7966a3dd367c4a3bb5b0cdf3b13383299af248c8d90d94d56e","group_id":"/memories/dave.md > # Dave","line_end":205,"line_start":205,"observation_ids":["obs-0001"],"path":"/memories/dave.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"recor